From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dan on Selwyn <dan@awto.au>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] awto: ungate WebShare and TrueSearch in the UI (#357)

- entitlements.service: WebShare/TrueSearch always entitled (shares card,
  route guard, SMB Spotlight, service form)
- license.service: hasTruenasConnect$ = true (WebShare-only users)
- webshare.service/card/list/service form: drop TrueNAS Connect and
  truenas.direct requirements; open via current host
---
